cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "apbCatalogR: Look Up APB Result Fields by Meaning"
abstract: "apbCatalogR looks up the fields of AnnData Proteomics Bridge (APB) results by meaning, such as a posterior error probability or an unnormalized intensity, without naming vendor columns. It is the R implementation of the apb-catalog API and reads APB results, h5ad, Parquet or DuckDB, into anndataR objects."
version: 0.99.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/anndata-omics-bridge/apbCatalogR"
url: "https://anndata-omics-bridge.github.io/apbCatalogR/"
authors:
